@startuml
 title SplitSmart Architecture 1 - expense activity (ADR-001)
start
:Signed-in user submits expense via Swing / HTTP;
:Provide amount, date, description, payer,
participants, equal/percentage split and optional receipt;
:Backend validates authentication, current membership,
required fields, positive amount/currency precision,
participants, exact percentages, image and review policy;
if (Submission valid?) then (yes)
  :Calculate deterministic exact shares;
  :Begin PostgreSQL submission transaction;
  :Recheck membership and snapshot approval policy;
  :Insert PENDING expense, shares, optional receipt,
review steps, audit and idempotency result;
  :Insert one notification row for each other
active group member (deduplicated);
  if (Submission transaction commits?) then (yes)
    :Return PENDING expense; balances unchanged;
    :Other members retrieve in-app notifications
through authorized polling after commit;
  else (no)
    :Roll back all submission writes;
    :Return retryable error; no expense,
notification or balance effects;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Return field / authorization error;
  :No persisted expense, notification or balance effects;
  stop
endif

repeat
  :Wait for current assigned reviewer's decision;
  :Begin review transaction; lock expense;
  :Revalidate actor, membership, reviewer eligibility,
current step, expected version and idempotency;
  if (Decision authorized and current?) then (yes)
    if (Reviewer rejects?) then (yes)
      :Record rejection and REJECTED outcome;
      if (Rejection transaction commits?) then (yes)
        :Return REJECTED; no ledger or balance update;
      else (no)
        :Roll back; expense remains pending at prior step;
        :Return retryable error;
      endif
      stop
    else (approve)
      if (All required levels now approved?) then (yes)
        :Lock affected pair balances in canonical order;
        :Record final decision and APPROVED state;
        :Append unique-source ledger entries;
        :Update pair balances exactly once;
        :Save audit and idempotency result;
        if (Final approval transaction commits?) then (yes)
          :Return APPROVED and committed balances;
          :Subsequent authorized reports read committed data;
        else (no)
          :Roll back decision, ledger and balance changes together;
          :Return retryable error; expense remains pending;
        endif
        stop
      else (more levels)
        :Record intermediate approval;
        if (Intermediate transaction commits?) then (yes)
          :Expense remains PENDING; advance review step;
          :No ledger or balance change;
        else (no)
          :Roll back intermediate decision;
          :Return retryable error; keep prior review step;
          stop
        endif
      endif
    endif
  else (no)
    :Roll back; return authorization / version conflict;
    :No new decision or financial effects;
    stop
  endif
repeat while (More required review levels?) is (yes)
stop
legend bottom
A stopped request leaves a pending expense available
for a later valid review/retry; it does not delete it.
Rejected correction is a separate new submission.
Submission notification timing follows DEC-007;
no new approval-notification requirement is implied.
endlegend
@enduml
